amily: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">년 하계방학 기간 중 현장실습을 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">회 이</span>상 참여한 재학생</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">재학생 외 휴학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">졸업생 등 참여 불가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">현장실습 중도포기자 참여 불가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; ※ 금오공과대학교 현장실습지원센터에서 주관한 현장실습만 해당</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">참여방법: <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">학생역량관리시스템(BISkit) → 비교과 신청 에서 \"2023 현장실습 수기공모전\"</span></span></b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\"><b>&nbsp;에서 참여</b></span><!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">수기내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span></b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">현장실습을 통해 느낀 귀중한 체험이야기</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">원고분량</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b>: </b>A4</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">용지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">페이지 이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">맑은고딕체 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">포인트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장평 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 