an style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">): 300,000</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">원 상당의 상품(에어팟 3세대)</span><br></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">금상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">): 200,000</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">원 상당의 상품(마샬 헤드셋)</span><br></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">은상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">): 100,000</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">원 상당의 상품(마사지건)</span><br></b></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">동상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">):&nbsp; 50,000</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">원 상당의 상품(핸디형 무선 청소기)</span></b><br></p><p class=\"0\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">수상자의 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">마일리지 추가 부여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">수상자가 직접 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">\"</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">자기주도활동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">\"</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">탭에서 신청</span></b><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\">수료 및 마일리지 지급은 만족도 조사 완료자에 한하여 진행</span>되오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-se